  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.23.0 source prepares descriptor-driven catalog creation with stable SDD CLI 2.5.3 or newer, admitted for creation and dry-run and rechecked before target mutation. Legacy typed knowledge retains its 2.1.0 floor; list/help remain independent of the installed catalog runtime. Catalog schema, published Template selection and registry defaults are unchanged. The catalog route is described against the published FS.GG.Templates 0.20.1 (tag fs-gg-templates/v0.20.1, package FS.GG.Workspace.Template 0.20.1), which carries the TypeScript, JavaScript, Rust and Go provider payloads with common project-knowledge composition; the Wizard still reads the catalog and exact Workspace.Template archive at the selected --ref. The independent release route reuses authenticated published coherent113 dependencies. Published Creator0.22 and its genuine112 dependency/effect identities remain immutable. Publication and genuine installed adoption require their own acceptance.",
